{
    "title": "Block Puzzle - Gems Adventure",
    "description": "\ud83e\udde9 Block Puzzle - Gems Adventure is an addictive IQ puzzle game, with simple yet challenging puzzles designed to train your brain. Challenge your puzzle game skills with this exciting game that will give you fun and challenge for hours.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udca5 Inspired by the treasure-hunting theme with wood, gold, and gems, Block Puzzle - Gems Adventure gives you an adventurous and classic puzzle-solving experience. The rule is simple: You can only use the block given randomly to fill lines in this 9x9 block puzzle board. Get the highest score and show the world you're the best block puzzle solver\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udca5 Train your brain and test your logical thinking with this simple game that lets you combine puzzle blocks, build and destroy structures by creating lines. Compete with friends around the world! Enjoy addicting brain training exercises with Block Puzzle - Gems Adventure\r\n\r\nOUR FEATURES:\r\n\r\n\ud83e\udde9 Connect Shapes, No Matter Where You Are\r\n\u2212 Organize puzzle blocks with different shapes into the puzzle board. Start and stop anytime, anywhere with no constrain.\r\n\u2212 Block Puzzle - Gems Adventure, a perfect challenge for a short period of refreshing brain training on the bus, at school, or in the office.\r\n\u2212 Connect shapes together with addicting, simple-to-learn brain teaser gameplay.\r\n\r\n\ud83e\udde9 Combine Puzzle Blocks in Addictive Games\r\n\u2212 Combine blocks and fill a full line of 9 blocks to destroy the line. The more lines destroyed, the more points you score!\r\n\u2212 Solve block puzzles in this addicting challenge that will put your logic skills to the test. Don't let the shapes fill the grid!\r\n\u2212 Match shapes to collect precious gems in this addictive puzzle game.\r\n\r\nPlay a simple puzzle game with no color matching, no time limit, and no match 3! Just fill the grid with shapes to form a line and train your logical thinking and problem-solving skills!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\ude0d Love puzzle games and looking for a game to play in your leisure time? Look no further, Block Puzzle - Gems Adventure is the perfect game you need!",
    "descriptionHTML": "\ud83e\udde9 Block Puzzle - Gems Adventure is an addictive IQ puzzle game, with simple yet challenging puzzles designed to train your brain. Challenge your puzzle game skills with this exciting game that will give you fun and challenge for hours.<br><br>\ud83d\udca5 Inspired by the treasure-hunting theme with wood, gold, and gems, Block Puzzle - Gems Adventure gives you an adventurous and classic puzzle-solving experience. The rule is simple: You can only use the block given randomly to fill lines in this 9x9 block puzzle board. Get the highest score and show the world you&#39;re the best block puzzle solver<br><br>\ud83d\udca5 Train your brain and test your logical thinking with this simple game that lets you combine puzzle blocks, build and destroy structures by creating lines. Compete with friends around the world! Enjoy addicting brain training exercises with Block Puzzle - Gems Adventure<br><br>OUR FEATURES:<br><br>\ud83e\udde9 Connect Shapes, No Matter Where You Are<br>\u2212 Organize puzzle blocks with different shapes into the puzzle board. Start and stop anytime, anywhere with no constrain.<br>\u2212 Block Puzzle - Gems Adventure, a perfect challenge for a short period of refreshing brain training on the bus, at school, or in the office.<br>\u2212 Connect shapes together with addicting, simple-to-learn brain teaser gameplay.<br><br>\ud83e\udde9 Combine Puzzle Blocks in Addictive Games<br>\u2212 Combine blocks and fill a full line of 9 blocks to destroy the line. The more lines destroyed, the more points you score!<br>\u2212 Solve block puzzles in this addicting challenge that will put your logic skills to the test. Don&#39;t let the shapes fill the grid!<br>\u2212 Match shapes to collect precious gems in this addictive puzzle game.<br><br>Play a simple puzzle game with no color matching, no time limit, and no match 3! Just fill the grid with shapes to form a line and train your logical thinking and problem-solving skills!<br><br>\ud83d\ude0d Love puzzle games and looking for a game to play in your leisure time? Look no further, Block Puzzle - Gems Adventure is the perfect game you need!",
